32
00:01:12,312 --> 00:01:14,508
plan mode, even if they seem simple.

33
00:01:15,181 --> 00:01:17,810
Plan mode is a mode where Claude Code will

34
00:01:17,922 --> 00:01:20,776
first gather some relevant information

35
00:01:20,968 --> 00:01:22,427
before starting work,

36
00:01:22,956 --> 00:01:25,585
