38
00:01:28,583 --> 00:01:29,997
It can help you turn

39
00:01:30,576 --> 00:01:32,680
average prompts into good prompts,

40
00:01:32,841 --> 00:01:33,371
essentially.

41
00:01:34,030 --> 00:01:35,363
And it allows you to

42
00:01:36,118 --> 00:01:38,464
